  "name": "Chicken 65",
  "subtitle": "Spiced yogurt-marinated fried chicken",
  "description": "Chicken thighs are marinated with warm spices, aromatics, and yogurt, coated with rice flour, fried until cooked through, then tossed with curry leaves, garlic, and green chillies.",
